{"step_index":10104,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T14:12:09Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-25T17:12:09+03:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-25T17:12:09+03:00\nFile Path: `file:///d:/AI_Engineer/Pharmacy-agy-vision/src/extract/file_handler.py`\nTotal Lines: 142\nTotal Bytes: 4881\nShowing lines 61 to 120\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n61: \n62: def read_input_files(\n63:     filepaths: list[Path],\n64:     role: str,\n65:     vision_api_url: str = \"http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions\",\n66:     vision_api_key: str = \"[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]\",\n67:     vision_model: str = \"gemini-3.8-flash\",\n68:     api_key: str | None = None,\n69:     base_url: str = \"https://transform.unstructured.io\",\n70:     gemini_api_key: str | None = None,\n71:     profile: str = \"balanced\",\n72: ) -> dict[str, list[dict]]:\n73:     role_label = \"Shortages\" if role == \"shortages\" else \"Warehouse\"\n74:     print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n75:     print(f\"[*] Processing {role_label} files ({len(filepaths)} file(s)) [PARALLEL WORKERS]\")\n76:     print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n77: \n78:     results: dict[str, list[dict]] = {}\n79: \n80:     if not filepaths:\n81:         return results\n82: \n83:     # Process files sequentially so single-tab browser gateway processes one file/page at a time cleanly\n84:     for idx, fp in enumerate(filepaths, start=1):\n85:         print(f\"\\n[{role_label} {idx}/{len(filepaths)}] Starting file: {Path(fp).name}\")\n86:         fname, items = _process_single_file(\n87:             fp,\n88:             vision_api_url=vision_api_url,\n89:             vision_api_key=vision_api_key,\n90:             vision_model=vision_model,\n91:             api_key=api_key,\n92:             base_url=base_url,\n93:             gemini_api_key=gemini_api_key,\n94:             profile=profile\n95:         )\n96:         results[fname] = items\n97: \n98:     total = sum(len(items) for items in results.values())\n99:     print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n100:     print(f\"[+] Completed {role_label}: {total} items from {len(results)} file(s)\")\n101:     print(f\"{'='*60}\\n\")\n102: \n103:     return results\n104: \n105: \n106: def _process_excel_file(filepath: Path) -> list[dict]:\n107:     rows = read_excel(filepath)\n108:     items = extract_item_names(rows, source_file=filepath.name)\n109:     return items\n110: \n111: \n112: def _process_markdown_file(filepath: Path) -> list[dict]:\n113:     return read_markdown_file(filepath)\n114: \n115: \n116: def _process_pdf_file(\n117:     filepath: Path,\n118:     vision_api_url: str = \"http://127.0.0.1:8001/v1/chat/completions\",\n119:     vision_api_key: str = \"[REDACTED_CREDENTIAL]\",\n120:     vision_model: str = \"gemini-3.8-flash\",\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
